      "supporting_quotes": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-5f91df4675bb",
          "exact": "A simple example of global tone mapping filter is Vout = Vin/(Vin+1) (Reinhard), where Vin is the luminance of the original pixel and Vout is the luminance of the filtered pixel."
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "VAL-001",
        "VAL-002"
      ],
      "rationale": "引文在 [0,46) 处表明 \"A simple example of global tone mapping filter\"，对应 claim 的\"全局色调映射的简单例子\"；[50,79) 处给出公式 \"Vout = Vin/(Vin+1) (Reinhard)\"，与 claim 的\"Reinhard 算子 Vout = Vin/(Vin+1)\"一致；[87,129) 处 \"Vin is the luminance of the original pixel\" 与 [134,178) 处 \"Vout is the luminance of the filtered pixel\" 分别对应 claim 的\"Vin 为原像素亮度\"与\"Vout 为映射后像素亮度\"。claim 的每个组成成分（示例、公式、两变量定义）均可逐项对应到引文，无增益或偏离，故判定 supported。",
